+          "section": "8",
+          "text": "# 8. Canonical Schema\n\nThe canonical schema is defined conceptually as follows.\n\n```text\n\n                    Document Identity\n                    ├── Identifier\n                    ├── Identity Domain\n                    ├── Lifecycle State\n                    └── Canonical Reference\n\n```\n\nThe schema defines the logical organisation of identity information.\n\nIt does not prescribe any implementation format.\n\n---\n\n"
